{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00468",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.98,
      "end_seconds": 4.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Hi, nice to see you. Sit down, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.51,
      "end_seconds": 6.21,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 7.46,
      "end_seconds": 11.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Hello, doctor, I came in with them, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.52,
      "end_seconds": 17.85,
      "duration_seconds": 5.33,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. We'll go through it together. Did you take the bus in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.96,
      "end_seconds": 23.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "Oh, um, I drove. The roads were quiet today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.04,
      "end_seconds": 28.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "What was the main thing you wanted to talk about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.17,
      "end_seconds": 43.33,
      "duration_seconds": 10.16,
      "text": "Oh, mainly I've been putting on weight over the last year. That's why I came. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.65,
      "end_seconds": 48.9,
      "duration_seconds": 5.25,
      "text": "How long has this been going on? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.12,
      "end_seconds": 52.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "I've had it for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.28,
      "end_seconds": 58.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "Have you been feeling out of breath on stairs?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.0,
      "end_seconds": 67.64,
      "duration_seconds": 8.64,
      "text": "Mm, yes. About feeling out of breath on stairs, pretty moderate, if I'm being honest. I've been snoring too, for four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.81,
      "end_seconds": 70.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "And heat intolerance, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.23,
      "end_seconds": 74.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Not at all, no heat intolerance."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.77,
      "end_seconds": 79.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Have you had any increased thirst, chest pain or low mood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.48,
      "end_seconds": 82.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Nothing like that, um, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.04,
      "end_seconds": 87.74,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Any palpitations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.09,
      "end_seconds": 91.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any palpitations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 92.41,
      "end_seconds": 96.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Actually, doctor, I did notice palpitations. He doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.19,
      "end_seconds": 102.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.25,
      "text": "No, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.42,
      "end_seconds": 109.98,
      "duration_seconds": 6.56,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.54,
      "end_seconds": 112.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "No, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.66,
      "end_seconds": 116.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Right, anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.14,
      "end_seconds": 119.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Yeah, no, that's all normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.32,
      "end_seconds": 123.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.21,
      "end_seconds": 124.91,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.0,
      "end_seconds": 137.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Alright, any long-term health problems I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.08,
      "end_seconds": 145.93,
      "duration_seconds": 7.85,
      "text": "Diabetes, for five years. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite. I've had high blood pressure, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.34,
      "end_seconds": 154.14,
      "duration_seconds": 7.8,
      "text": "Yes, I can see the diabetes in your file as well. Alright, anyone in the family with similar problems or other conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.1,
      "end_seconds": 158.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "My mother has diabetes. My father had kidney stones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.92,
      "end_seconds": 162.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "Do you have any known allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.51,
      "end_seconds": 164.25,
      "duration_seconds": 0.74,
      "text": "No allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.62,
      "end_seconds": 167.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "Has anything about your daily routine changed lately?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.17,
      "end_seconds": 185.02,
      "duration_seconds": 16.85,
      "text": "Not really, uh, the days are pretty much the same, work and home, and I've been trying to fit appointments in around my schedule, which isn't always easy, so I'm glad we could find a time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.33,
      "end_seconds": 188.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Alright, have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.66,
      "end_seconds": 191.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "No operations, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.58,
      "end_seconds": 196.85,
      "duration_seconds": 5.27,
      "text": "Any medication at the moment, including things from the pharmacy? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 197.32,
      "end_seconds": 201.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.59,
      "text": "Uh, I'm on metformin, twice a day for my sugar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.5,
      "end_seconds": 204.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.13,
      "end_seconds": 215.13,
      "duration_seconds": 10.0,
      "text": "It's 500 milligrams. I take losartan, 50 milligrams, once a day. I'd been on amlodipine, not any more though, I stopped."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.29,
      "end_seconds": 217.28,
      "duration_seconds": 0.99,
      "text": "How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.5,
      "end_seconds": 221.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "I smoke, yes, around five a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.99,
      "end_seconds": 223.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "Alright, what about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.5,
      "end_seconds": 231.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "I have a couple of drinks on the weekend."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.53,
      "end_seconds": 234.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Let me check your vitals now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.9,
      "end_seconds": 242.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "Okay, just relax your arm..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.66,
      "end_seconds": 267.41,
      "duration_seconds": 11.75,
      "text": "Okay: BMI works out to 20.8, temperature is 36.4 degrees. And saturation 97 percent, pressure 122 over 69, pulse is 76 beats a minute, height 158 centimetres, respiratory rate 15, weight 52 kilos."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.09,
      "end_seconds": 272.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.78,
      "end_seconds": 276.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Okay, I'll just listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.38,
      "end_seconds": 298.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Your waist measures about a hundred and four centimetres."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.29,
      "end_seconds": 301.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.0,
      "text": "Yes, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.77,
      "end_seconds": 316.18,
      "duration_seconds": 9.41,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.87,
      "end_seconds": 320.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Alright, I want to open your previous notes quickly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 320.61,
      "end_seconds": 321.35,
      "duration_seconds": 0.74,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 335.07,
      "end_seconds": 361.59,
      "duration_seconds": 26.52,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. So, based on the history and the examination, I think we're dealing with weight gain with a metabolic cause that needs checking at this stage. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. Sleep apnoea is also on my list. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've been putting on weight over the last year for two years, and no heat intolerance or low mood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 362.36,
      "end_seconds": 363.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 364.12,
      "end_seconds": 378.47,
      "duration_seconds": 14.35,
      "text": "It's quite normal to feel unsure at this point. People often expect an instant answer, but a good assessment usually has a few stages, and today is mainly about narrowing things down and making a sensible plan together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 378.92,
      "end_seconds": 381.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Uh, that's reassuring to hear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 382.77,
      "end_seconds": 405.24,
      "duration_seconds": 22.47,
      "text": "I'm going to order a lipid profile, for metabolic risk. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. Let's get an HbA1c, for weight gain. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. I'm going to order a sleep study, for snoring and sleepiness. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 405.63,
      "end_seconds": 408.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Sure, where do I go for that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 408.68,
      "end_seconds": 424.07,
      "duration_seconds": 15.39,
      "text": "Start with small, specific changes: smaller portions, no sugary drinks, a thirty-minute walk most days. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference. Please don't sit on it if the symptoms get worse. That's the point to get seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 427.27,
      "end_seconds": 429.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "Got it, you know, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 431.19,
      "end_seconds": 434.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again in six weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 435.68,
      "end_seconds": 437.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "Okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 439.0,
      "end_seconds": 443.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "I want to be sure we're on the same page. How would you describe the plan?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 444.94,
      "end_seconds": 449.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "So, I come back in six weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 450.73,
      "end_seconds": 456.09,
      "duration_seconds": 5.36,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Good. Call the clinic if you need us in the meantime."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 456.69,
      "end_seconds": 460.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "No, um, you've explained it well. Thanks."
    }
  ]
}